SAAQ Backend — Stage Classifier & Awareness Quotient

This backend implements two self-contained psychometric modules for the SAAQ Project:

1. Stage Classifier – evaluates developmental “Stages of Awareness” (S1–S8) using linguistic, cognitive, and emotional indicators.  
2. Awareness Quotient (AQ) – quantifies depth of awareness across six key dimensions: Self-Awareness, Emotional Regulation, Perspective Awareness, Meta-Awareness, Systemic Awareness, and Integrative Awareness.

Both modules are standalone, require no external APIs, and run fully offline using deterministic scoring logic.

